<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 802 mln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 802 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction July 22 versus July 15:</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   175/182		356/363</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.14/3.16	    3.46/3.44</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.14/3.16	    3.46/3.45</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.14/3.15	    3.45/3.43</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   70/185		732/180</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    361/185	     870/270</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 45,758 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
